#Object Name: Holly
#File Name: holly01.plg
#Author: Sean Ziegeler
#Date: 10/25/95
#Description: A plant with Holly looking leaves.  It is a derivative of a
#             Fibonacci Series L-system.
#Comments: It has 6 indexible colors.  This is helpful if you want a fall
#          version of the plant you can map some of the colors to be yellow
#          or red if you want "fall-looking" leaves.  If you just want a
#          normal plant, make all indices green.

